   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# LTXE HDR Review and QC (experimental)\n\nChecks a shot delivered by *LTXE SDR -> HDR Pro* before it goes out. Set `shot_name` and `output_folder` to the\nvalues used there and run. No model is loaded.\n\n**What it checks**\n- Every frame of the shot is present once (missing windows and frames are listed), readable, with no NaN / Inf.\n- EXR header: half / float, compression, ACEScg primaries, frame rate.\n- Exposure jumps between neighbouring frames (seams) and flicker; how much of each frame is above 1.0.\n\n**Result**: `accept`, `review` (warnings to look at) or `hold` (something is missing or broken). Nothing is\nre-rendered automatically: retry a window in the Pro workflow by setting its `window` number.\n\nThe contact sheet is a tonemapped preview (its exposure never touches the EXRs). Depth, normals, vectors and the\nmatte are not delivered yet (A23 P3)."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "# LTXE HDR Review and QC (experimental)\n\nChecks a shot delivered by *LTXE SDR -> HDR Pro* before it goes out. Set `shot_name` and `output_folder` to the\nvalues used there and run. No model is loaded.\n\n**What it checks**\n- Every frame of the shot is present once (missing windows and frames are listed), readable, with no NaN / Inf.\n- EXR header: half / float, compression, ACEScg primaries, frame rate.\n- Exposure jumps between neighbouring frames (seams) and flicker; how much of each frame is above 1.0.\n\n**Result**: `accept`, `review` (warnings to look at) or `hold` (something is missing or broken). Nothing is\nre-rendered automatically: retry a window in the Pro workflow by setting its `window` number.\n\nThe contact sheet is a tonemapped preview (its exposure never touches the EXRs). Depth, normals, vectors and the\nmatte are not delivered yet (A23 P3)."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
